     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"{x^2} - 8x + 15\"></span></p>\n<p>Look for two factors of 15 that add up to –8.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Factors of 8</td>\n<td>Sum of Factors = –8</td>\n<td>Success?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 times 15</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"1 + 15 = 16\"></span></td>\n<td>No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 times 5</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"3 + 5 = 8\"></span></td>\n<td>No, but the sum is 8, so change signs.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>–3 times –5</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"-3 + \\left({-5} \\right) = -8\"></span></td>\n<td>Yes!</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left({x - 3} \\right)\\left({x - 5} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Write the factored form.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>This is the correct option.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
